# Code owners for et-dagen.
#
# This exists to gate production releases. The `prod` branch ruleset requires
# code owner review, so every `dev` -> `prod` pull request needs an approval
# from a member of @et-dagen/managers.
#
# Ordinary feature pull requests into `dev` are unaffected by this file: `dev`
# requires one approval from any member with write access, and code owner
# review is only enforced by the `prod` ruleset.

* @et-dagen/managers
